    {
      "id": "claim_69f3cccfb1484da5b2f6cfb8adc3b075",
      "statement": "Recipe styles and connector templates use rules to determine which positions they apply to. Rules evaluate against position records containing DesignDB columns, position family, tags, Form fields, and recipe contents. When multiple rules match, the most specific rule wins, with specificity computed from how much of the project each condition rules out.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/utils/recipeStyles.js#L1-L19",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ed81d053c64366cab160dcb854a5a8c6755b30ac08f948e81c15ab6f4ab7fe32:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/utils/templateRules.js#L69-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:00d3aeabd09f1ba5450a921345b6936aea676bb7308c9a2c4c61a93954b61580:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fc5a343a81304c03a2dd09fdd96cb8d4",
      "statement": "Rule specificity is computed as log₂(total positions / positions matching this condition). For AND rules, condition bits are summed. For OR rules, specificity reflects the union of matched positions. A narrower rule (whose positions all fall within another's) beats it regardless of bit scores.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/utils/templateRules.js#L128-L146",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bcd60e37191f90468d813c0ee3121cc5fb01cd692c21d6d289b347cc1ef3af47:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/utils/templateRules.js#L84-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3a47ae9bc9401bd0f719c1f3b15f8ae627756e2a55f3f85ab80ec3256851b537:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3d930424321b4e96b3af90ab9631141b",
      "statement": "SaveTemplateModal allows users to save a position's recipe as a template by: (1) building and confirming the recipe, (2) choosing a name and scope, (3) unticking rows that should not travel, and (4) optionally adding tags. Wrappers are marked to be created new each time; Form products are marked as slots to be swapped.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/components/SaveTemplateModal.jsx#L1-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:edab5e7cd111bcab9b88ad856b482d2715f7e02af847071ce162bb727e509bd0:"
