    {
      "id": "claim_a009fd8f82384a88a58b6fc04c4acbac",
      "statement": "Three template types exist: recipe templates (a saved recipe with Form slots and ingredient flags), connector templates (wiring blueprints with rules), and recipe styles (a taught recipe plus a rule, for positions built the same way). All three use rules for position matching.",
