    {
      "id": "claim_a0c1b9a947fb4956ac3c3d316fa1929b",
      "statement": "The proposal system makes no silent guesses. Every row in a proposed recipe states its source (this project, projects opened before, shipped patterns, or empty). Parts the system cannot vouch for are left empty and flagged for manual confirmation.",
