    {
      "id": "claim_32551b9024ce450db0b68fbd153111fe",
      "statement": "Form products always travel with their role. If a position's Form specifies a TAPE product, that same product ref appears in the next position's recipe when that position's Form product has the TAPE role, regardless of wrapper type. Form products are abstracted in recipe shapes.",
