    {
      "id": "claim_59bb6347ed99405ca240504ddf5b444b",
      "statement": "Companion server integration is optional and invisible. The app is complete without one; a companion provides shared library, patterns, and project decisions via REST APIs. All companion failures are silent; the app behaves identically when the companion is absent.",
