    {
      "id": "claim_183595b0a3a94280a5482f38a6153219",
      "statement": "roleOf(ref, family) determines the semantic role of an ElementType: WRAPPER, DRIVER, FRAME, TAPE, FLEX, PROFILE, CLIP, MOUNT, FIXED, TRACK, PS, ACCESSORY, LEVER, and named connector roles (2PIN-SOCKET, 5PIN-PLUG, etc.). Connectors keep their names (the company names them consistently). Roles determine how parts are placed in recipes.",
